Subject: [PATCH 01/10] staging: iio: tsl2583: add of_match table for device tree support
Date: Fri, 28 Oct 2016 06:00:12 -0400
Message-Id: <1477648821-3786-2-git-send-email-masneyb@onstation.org>
In-Reply-To: <1477648821-3786-1-git-send-email-masneyb@onstation.org>
